Cynthia consumes 60 servings in 60 days (1 serving per day). Each carton contains 15 servings, so she needs \\(60 \\div 15 = 4\\) cartons. At $4.00 per carton, the total cost is \\(4 \\times 4 = 16\\) dollars.

Thus, after 60 days, she will have spent **$16.00** on ice cream.

